---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Disclaimer | BitsNotes" 
  description="Read the BitsNotes Disclaimer to understand content accuracy, the study-aid nature of our notes, and university non-affiliation."
  keywords="bitsnotes disclaimer, educational disclaimer, notes accuracy, academic study aid, non affiliation disclaimer"
  robots="index, follow"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "name": "Disclaimer",
      "description": "BitsNotes legal disclaimer regarding content accuracy, study aids, and non-affiliation.",
      "url": "https://bitsnotes.com/disclaimer"
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 flex-grow">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text)] tracking-tight leading-tight">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-[var(--text-muted)]">Last updated: June 30, 2026. Please read this disclaimer before using any study materials on BitsNotes.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text)] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">1. Educational and Study Aid Purpose Only</h2>
        <p>BitsNotes is an independent educational platform created as a personal study resource and learning aid. All lecture notes, study guides, exam revision materials, and practice quizzes (collectively, the "Content") provided on this website are designed for informational and self-study purposes only. They are not a substitute for formal instruction, official textbooks, or direct syllabus materials from your academic institution.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-[var(--border)]" />

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">2. Content Accuracy and Errors</h2>
        <p>While we make every effort to ensure the accuracy, completeness, and clarity of the notes, the Content is synthesized from personal lecture recordings, course transcripts, student notes, and references. Consequently, the Content may contain typographical errors, conceptual simplifications, or factual inaccuracies. BitsNotes does not warrant or guarantee that the materials are entirely correct, complete, or up-to-date. You use this Content entirely at your own risk.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-[var(--border)]" />

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">3. No Academic Affiliation or Endorsement</h2>
        <p>BitsNotes is **not** affiliated with, sponsored by, endorsed by, or in any way associated with any university, college, academic institution, or course instructor. Any references to specific university courses, subject names, course numbers, or lecture syllabi are purely for organizational convenience and contextual reference. The views and interpretations expressed in these notes are solely those of the author and do not reflect the official policies or curriculum of any academic institution.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-[var(--border)]" />

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">4. Personal Academic Responsibility</h2>
        <p>You assume full responsibility for your academic performance. It is your duty to verify all equations, theorems, algorithms, programming code, and concepts against your official course syllabus, instructor slides, and recommended reading list prior to any exams, quizzes, or graded submissions. BitsNotes will not be held liable for any loss of marks, exam failures, academic misconduct charges, or other negative educational outcomes resulting from the use of this website.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-[var(--border)]" />

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">5. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>This Platform may contain links to external sites that are not operated by us. We have no control over, and assume no responsibility for, the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites or services linked from our notes.</p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-[var(--border)]" />

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">6. Changes to this Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify or replace this Disclaimer at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated modification date. Your continued use of the website following any changes constitutes acceptance of those changes.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
